WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.308
The receiving test node issues an invoice, here in the app’s terminal.

2
00:00:09.308 --> 00:00:22.345
Paste it into the chat and say how much to send.

3
00:00:22.345 --> 00:00:30.970
Nothing is signed yet: the card spells out amount, asset, recipient and network.

4
00:00:30.970 --> 00:00:36.605
Approved once. The node sends on the test network.

5
00:00:36.605 --> 00:00:41.638
The receiver settles the transfer.

6
00:00:41.638 --> 00:01:01.633
The RGB tab, read through Tether WDK: the send is in flight, 78 USDT of change still incoming.
